# Store all text files with LF line endings in the repo.
# Git converts them to the platform's line endings on checkout (CRLF on Windows with core.autocrlf).
* text=auto

# Never touch binary files
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.mp3 binary
*.m4a binary
